<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>

<section xml:id="sec-trig-identities" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude">

    <title>Trigonometric Identities</title>
    <introduction>
        <p>
            In this section, we will learn to verify the fundamental trigonometric identities and to
            simplify trigonometric expressions using algebra and the identities.
        </p>
    </introduction>

    <subsection>
        <title>Textbook Reference</title>
        <p> 
            This relates to content in <section-mark/>9.1 of 
            <url href="https://openstax.org/details/books/algebra-and-trigonometry-2e" visual="http://tiny.cc/111Z-Textbook">Algebra and Trigonometry 2e</url>.
        </p>
    </subsection>

